  "ruleText": "Liq 907.02 Hours and Procedures. On-premise licensees approved for credit purchases under Liq 902.02 may purchase wine and liquor from the warehouse or the commission liquor stores as provided in Liq 402.01.\n\nSource. #13225, eff 6-30-21",
